---
import Verticalgrid from "../assets/Verticalgrid.astro";
---

<section class="bg-[#f9f9f9]">
<Verticalgrid />
  <div class="mx-auto max-w-7xl py-12 lg:px-16 md:px-12 px-8 xl:px-18 items-center lg:py-[72px] relative w-full">
    <div class="mx-auto text-center">
      <h2 class="">Key Tools to Boost Repeat Orders</h2>
      <p class="max-w-2xl mx-auto mt-4">Points, VIP, referrals, gift cards, and coupons work seamlessly together to create the ultimate rewards program for your business.</p>
    </div>
    <div class="mx-auto grid md:grid-cols-2 lg:grid-cols-3 gap-14 mt-10">
      <div class="flex flex-col  p-[0.060rem] bg-white rounded-3xl border border-gray-200">
        <div class="px-6 py-8 sm:p-10 sm:pb-6">
          <div class="grid items-center justify-center w-full grid-cols-1 text-left">
            <div>
              <img alt="Fiserv gift cards" class="text-center" width="176" height="176" src="/assets/shopify/GC.webp">
              <h3 class=" text-2xl mt-8 text-black">Issue Personalized Gift Cards to your Customers</h3>
              <p class="mt-2">Fiserv and 99minds enable your business to offer a seamless gift card experience, allowing customers to easily purchase, send, and customize branded gift cards both in-store and online.</p>
            </div>
          </div>
        </div>
        

      </div>
      <div class="flex flex-col  p-[0.060rem] bg-white rounded-3xl border border-gray-200">
        <div class="px-6 py-8 sm:p-10 sm:pb-6">
          <div class="grid items-center justify-center w-full grid-cols-1 text-left">
            <div>
              <img alt="Fiserv loyalty" class="text-center" width="176" height="176" src="/assets/shopify/LP.webp">
              <h3 class="mt-8">Robust and Flexible Loyalty Program</h3>
              <p class="mt-2">Build a custom loyalty program to suit your guests’ needs from the best design options in the industry.</p>
            </div>
          </div>
        </div>
        
      </div>
      <div class="flex flex-col  p-[0.060rem] bg-white rounded-3xl border border-gray-200">
        <div class="px-6 py-8 sm:p-10 sm:pb-6">
          <div class="grid items-center justify-center w-full grid-cols-1 text-left">
            <div>
              <img alt="Fiserv coupons" class="text-center" width="176" height="176" src="/assets/shopify/SC.webp">
              <h3 class="mt-8">Smart Coupon Generation</h3>
              <p class="mt-2">Dynamic & personalize coupon generation for your store.</p>
            </div>
          </div>
        </div>
       
      </div>

  </div>
   <div class="flex flex-col justify-center max-w-xl gap-2 mx-auto sm:flex-row">
   <div class="flex flex-wrap justify-center gap-2 lg:mt-10">
          <a href="https://giftcard.99minds.io/access/register" target="_blank" class="raise1 relative p-0.5 inline-flex items-center justify-center font-bold overflow-hidden group rounded-md font-medium">
                <span class="w-full h-full bg-black absolute"></span>
                <span class="relative px-4 py-2 transition-all ease-out bg-gray-900 bg-opacity-0 rounded-md group-hover:bg-opacity-10 duration-400">
                <span class="relative text-white">Install 99minds for free</span>
                </span>
          </a>
      </div>
      </div>
</section>
